# Docker build context lives at the repo root (apps/redact-fn/Dockerfile needs the
# pnpm workspace). Keep the context tiny — exclude everything the build doesn't
# need. A context-ROOT .dockerignore is the reliable mechanism (BuildKit's
# per-Dockerfile `<name>.dockerignore` is NOT honored across versions).
**/node_modules
.git
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/out
**/.next
**/.terraform
**/*.tfstate
**/*.tfstate.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.build
release
*.log
.DS_Store
# heavy design/asset trees not needed to build the redaction server
.claude
**/public/tesseract
